Good.

587
00:22:31,360 --> 00:22:32,719
That was so fast.

588
00:22:32,720 --> 00:22:34,000
Ten seconds.

589
00:22:34,400 --> 00:22:35,519
Really fast.

590
00:22:35,520 --> 00:22:36,880
Impressive.

591
00:22:38,520 --> 00:22:39,520
So what now?

592
00:22:40,800 --> 00:22:42,680
Ready, three, two, one, go.

593
00:22:49,360 --> 00:22:50,920
What are you two doing?

594
00:22:54,400 --> 00:22:55,920
They look like they're fighting.

595
00:23:04,280 --> 00:23:06,760
Congrats on a fifteen-second time.

596
00:23:18,320 --> 00:23:19,759
Congratulations to all four teams

597
00:23:19,760 --> 00:23:21,879
for completing the game objective.

598
00:23:21,880 --> 00:23:24,039
Please welcome Sun Mingyang as the representative

599
00:23:24,040 --> 00:23:26,200
to come get your snacks.

600
00:23:34,920 --> 00:23:37,039
I want the cheese sticks.

601
00:23:37,040 --> 00:23:38,239
Then I'll take an Oreo.

602
00:23:38,240 --> 00:23:39,719
Here, look, this one's for you.

603
00:23:39,720 --> 00:23:40,720
It's your favorite.
